    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Ultimate is a modern interpretation of the classic Snake game with enhanced features and a fresh design. The game combines the proven gameplay of the original with new challenges and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Classic Snake gameplay with modern graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highscore system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Achievement system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customizable controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Classic Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Traditional Snake game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Increasing speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Score collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Challenge Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Special challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Time-based tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Special power-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arrow keys for movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- P key for pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ESC for menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic background music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visual effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adjustable playfield size</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various snake skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System Requirements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Windows operating system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Modern hardware (see system_requirements.txt)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- At least 100 MB free storage space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Python and Pygame, Snake Ultimate offers a smooth gaming experience with modern graphics and sound. The game is suitable for both casual gamers and fans of the classic Snake game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Online features and multiplayer mode are planned for future updates.</p>",
